WEBVTT

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:46.720
The Takamagahara Commemorative

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.770
<b>Takamagahara Commemorative 

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.970
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup!

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:12.710
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.550
<b>Episode 8  An Equestrian Fit for a Cat</b>

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:41.260
Everyone!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:44.170
The Takamagahara Commemorative

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:46.920
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup 
begins this afternoon!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:48.520
<b>Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup</b>

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.520
Be sure you're ready!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.060
Oh, the Manager's Cup? 
It's that time already?

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:55.340
Please don't shorten it to "Manager's Cup"!

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:58.330
It's the Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:02.030
The Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.330
You sound awfully haughty.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.300
Of course I do!

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.820
We must make this year's 
Takamagahara Commemorative

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.120
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup exciting!

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.830
U-Um...

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.130
Sorry. What is this "Manager's Cup"?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.210
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.760
Huh? Wh-What's wrong?

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.480
It's all right, Takeru-san.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.730
This is my own fault.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:40.490
<b>Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup</b>

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:33.740
The Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.850
is a historical ritual in the Eto realm,

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:39.740
and I'm the Eto-shin in charge 
of this very important event.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:40.240
stick

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.490
Yet...

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:54.500
Takamagahara Commemorative Maid Café Eto
Manager's Cup God Viewership Ratings

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:44.460
As you can see, the viewers 
among the gods have plummeted.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:48.050
The previous Takamagahara 
Commemorative Maid Café Eto

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:50.410
Manager's Cup only earned a rating of 1.8%.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.500
If it drops below 1%, it will be canceled!

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:56.230
God viewership rating?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:58.920
It's what it sounds like: 
the number of gods who watch it.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.940
All divine rituals are 
overseen by the many gods.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.730
The more important or noteworthy the ritual,

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:07.680
the higher the god ratings.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.150
Oh...

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.910
You are included in the god 
viewership rating, as well.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:12.270
Huh?

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.730
You watch the ETM12 on the 
Sol/Lull TV, do you not?

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:19.790
That registers as god viewership.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.950
Really? I'm not a god, though...

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.450
You're a unique situation, Takeru-san.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.660
Yeah. Normally the Sol/Lull TV is

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.910
only summoned in front of gods.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.860
So if there's a boring ritual 
or dull program on,

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:35.710
the gods turn the Sol/Lull TV off.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.420
The process isn't that simple!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.420
<b>Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup</b>

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.530
Now, instead of watching in 
real time, many gods record it,

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.430
or watch via methods that

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.630
aren't reflected in the ratings...

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:49.480
Incidentally, I prefer to record things 
and watch them at my leisure.

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:50.530
Ditto!

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:52.850
And that's why our god 
ratings are dropping!

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:56.320
Shows just keep piling up before 
I can watch them, though.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:59.440
Yeah, and then I can't be bothered 
to watch and just delete them.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.530
Oh, if you buy the Blu-rays, 
that won't happen.

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:05.250
I'm not buying those. 
I don't have the money.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.860
And I don't have anywhere to put them.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:10.500
People like you are the reason 
there's so much insecurity in this industry!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.670
Buy the discs!

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.060
Show proper gratitude to 
the staff who sweat blood

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.670
and wipe their tears with more 
tears producing these things!

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:20.180
Don't just watch with a dumb look on 
your face! If you watch it, buy it!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:22.880
Money needs to be put into 
circulation in this world!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.510
U-Uh... Right...

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:26.760
I'm saying—

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:30.260
Save that discussion for next time.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:34.390
I'm talking about something much 
more important right now.

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:37.070
Wow. She doesn't just freak out,

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.790
but actually takes charge 
when she needs to.

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:42.370
Of all the Chinese zodiac,

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:45.070
Uma-tan is among the one 
or two most serious.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.030
In other words, she's the type 
that's a pain to deal with.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.070
You didn't have to add that last part...

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.660
I'm a pain to deal with?!

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:53.500
See?

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.210
Don't say that!

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.670
It's because you said 
something so venomous!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:00.800
Er, I wasn't talking about you, Shar-tan.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.240
Ah, that's my Takeru-san!

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.950
What a thoughtful follow-up! 
You're so wonderful!

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:08.050
Uh, it's nothing to swoon about...

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:09.930
Come on, stop crying!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.940
Jeez, comebacks are a full-time job when

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:14.930
the entire cast is here for once...

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.050
A-Anyway, the average god 
rating for this year's

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:19.920
Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.420
will determine the fate of the

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:26.740
Takamagahara Commemorative Maid 
Café Eto Manager's Cup!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.700
If it does end up being canceled...

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:33.970
As it is, people say the zodiac animals from 
"horse" onward have an unpleasant sound...

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.670
but I'll be unable to do 
my job as an Eto-shin,

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:39.620
<b>Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup</b>

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:40.290
and there'll be no meaning to my existence!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.110
No meaning? You're exaggerating!

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:45.670
If you want god ratings, just strip!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.050
Take it off!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:50.620
I wanna see Nya-tan fully nude! Come on!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.010
I'll take 'em off for you!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.100
I got a treasure!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.500
Not happening!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.440
Ouch!

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:02.640
But that was pretty nice, too...

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.110
Get lost, pervert!

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:09.080
A vulgar idea such as nudity 
is out of the question.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.810
We must make this a thrilling race that

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:14.770
will resonate directly 
in the god ratings.

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:16.490
I can't say this too loud,

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:19.830
but this is a raging battle 
against the gods!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.980
Now, everyone, until the start 
of the race, let us discuss—

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.000
E-Everyone?

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.820
I just can't get fired up about this.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:31.060
It's kinda tiring.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:34.290
Instead of humiliating yourself fighting 
for it, you should just call it off.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:38.160
You're not even one of the zodiac, 
stupid cat! This isn't your business!

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.480
Stay out of it!

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.230
Huh? But even if you bust your butt to win,

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.630
there's no prize or anything.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.760
Of course there isn't.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:50.230
There's meaning in seeing the 
race through to the end!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:52.230
What a boring race!

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:55.200
It's not an issue of whether 
it's boring or not!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:00.710
Enough insolent talk!

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:03.780
Manager!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.500
However, the cat does have a point.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.580
If they are unmotivated, 
we just need to motivate them!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.940
For this year's Takamagahara Commemorative

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:16.360
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup,

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:19.090
I will...

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:21.640
grant...

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.230
the winner's wish!

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:25.890
For real?!

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:27.290
What brought that reward on?!

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:31.190
Grant their wish? You're 
talking like you're a god...

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:34.010
If you doubt me, I will show you

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:42.930
my true form!

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:48.210
I am the manager.

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:50.680
Wh-What is this?

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:55.310
Meow! That's the coffee cup 
I broke and then hid!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.470
It's fixed!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.470
May there be light for all.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:07.010
Meow, meow! That's the dying 
bird I've been caring for!

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:09.650
Live alongside me, little one.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:13.740
It's fixed!

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:18.420
Meow! That's yesterday's leftover 
meat and potato stew!

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.520
Become delicious.

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:25.160
It's been remade into curry.

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:27.790
Super tasty!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.610
Impressive as always, Manager.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:36.120
She's right. You really are 
amazing, Mr. Manager.

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:39.020
Well, I did create Japan, after all.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.280
Anyway, now I know you 
can perform any miracle,

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.440
from bringing back the dead to 
reusing meat and potato stew!

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:46.440
That means...

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:50.630
Granting our wishes will be easy!

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:51.530
Wishes...

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:53.040
Wishes...

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.940
Wishes, huh?

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:57.710
One...

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.610
Two...

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:04.540
Three.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.790
I... I remember...

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.290
Even after taking three steps,

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.040
I still remember!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:18.650
Mei-tan.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:22.820
T-Takeru-san...

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.560
Beautiful Nya-tan

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.580
Master...

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.860
Sparkle, sparkle, sparkle...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.490
Sesame, sesame, sesame, sesame, sesame...

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.430
Sesame oil! Yep, yep!

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:43.330
Meow! Meow! Meow!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.580
Nya-tan, Nya-tan, Nya-tan, Nya-tan, Nya-tan...

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.080
Nya-tan in bed!

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:02.260
<b>Aged Bone</b>

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.590
Yum!

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.020
This rocks!

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:07.310
I bet all kinds of crazy wishes are

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.110
dancing about in their heads right now.

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.790
I don't need any reward!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.420
As long as the Takamagahara Commemorative

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.440
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup is successful!

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.270
Now, everyone,

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.700
strive for victory in the Manager's 
Cup with all your body and soul!

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:26.700
Right!

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.450
<i>To all the many gods and goddesses:</i>

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.670
<i>the wait is over!</i>

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:35.700
<i>It's the Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup!</i>

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:39.040
<i>Commentating live from 
Takamagahara's special track</i>

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:42.190
<i>is yours truly, the guardian deity of 
travelers, and my special guest, the Manager!</i>

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:44.700
<i>Thank you, thank you! I 
 also sponsor the race!</i>

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.010
<i>So, Manager,</i>

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.720
<i>tell us who you think will win this race.</i>

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:49.880
<i>Only the gods know!</i>

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:51.770
<b>The current god viewership rating is 3.5%.</b>

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.250
<i>Correct! And then...</i>

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:51.900
<i>And then...</i>

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:52.520
<i>And then...</i>

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.480
They're showing off the god 
ratings on the screen...

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.110
<i>And then...</i>

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:53.680
<i>And then...</i>

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:54.320
<i>And then...</i>

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.480
<i>And then...</i>

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.780
<i>Now, it looks like all the racers 
are standing by to begin.</i>

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.450
My hammer shoots flames!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.400
What are you doing here?!

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.120
Well, Chu-tan didn't show up!

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:12.180
So it makes sense that I fill 
in the rat's position!

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:13.620
Me!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:14.120
Ox!

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:14.630
Tiger!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:15.130
Rabbit!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:15.630
Dragon!

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:16.080
Snake!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:16.690
Snake...

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:19.960
Meow!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.130
It stopped at me again!

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.500
You start there!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.480
I don't wanna be in the back!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.140
I don't wanna! I don't wanna!

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:33.720
Be quiet.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:37.350
You're still only an Eto-musume.

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:40.350
This race is a sacred divine ritual.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.990
Someone who isn't an Eto-shin can't just—

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:45.160
<i>Okay! Everyone face forward!</i>

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.680
<i>Here we go!</i>

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.570
Time to fly!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.630
Uri!

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.060
<i>Oh, my! A series of crashes already!</i>

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:14.270
<i>Uri-tan has died, 
and Piyo-tan has lost her memory!</i>

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.730
<b>Boar                    Rooster</b>

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:23.010
That was a quick withdrawal 
and reincarnation.

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.880
This was our fate.

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.880
<i>Oh? It looks like there's still</i>

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:29.240
<i>a racer at the starting line!</i>

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.850
<i>If... If I win, I'll be Takeru-san's...</i>

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:34.490
Takeru-san's...

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.290
Oh, gosh! I'm so embarrassed!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.290
<b>Sheep</b>

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:42.900
I can't tell if she's motivated or not.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.010
Y-Yeah.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:52.720
<i>Taking an early lead are 
Shima-tan and Dora-tan!</i>

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.350
<i>Both are entering the magical</i>

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.940
<i>Raw-Barley-Raw-Rice-Raw-Gods Curve!</i>

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.530
Whoa, that's dangerous!

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.990
The Raw-Barley-Raw-Rice-Raw-Gods Curve is

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.170
the toughest part of the course.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:11.970
Takeru-san, no... You can't do that...

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.970
I can't believe she took it from 
the outside without stopping her

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:14.670
secondary turbine by caramelizing 
it with a split twist lift!

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:16.860
But... If it's you, Takeru-san...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.060
You just made that more aromatic 
at the end by boiling sugar...

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.000
Oh, no!

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:19.670
We can't take our eyes off this race.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.170
<i>And now for an interview 
with the two leaders.</i>

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.990
<i>Manager, it's all yours!</i>

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:26.170
No... You mustn't do that...

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.170
<i>Right! I'm on it!</i>

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.340
<i>Hey, there!</i>

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.760
<i>So what are both of your wishes?</i>

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.550
I'm blind!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.060
Shima-tan and Dora-tan are 
both off the course!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.350
What a shame! Truly a shame!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.350
<b>Dragon                       Tiger</b>

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:41.230
Hey, what the hell?! 
Don't interview us there!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.610
Wait... You don't think we were

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.610
cut from the program for time, do you?

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.940
<i>You two are grown-ups, 
so you understand, right?</i>

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:49.680
<i>Kidding!</i>

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:51.740
What a pity.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:54.780
<i>Oh! Taking the lead from 
Shima-tan and Dora-tan</i>

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.870
<i>are Key-tan and Inu-tan, 
racing side by side!</i>

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.020
Here, Inu-tan! An aged bone!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.250
<b>Aged Bone</b>

00:14:59.020 --> 00:14:59.670
Huh?

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:03.090
Actually, I wanted to give you 
a present too, Key-tan...

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.250
Here you go! Legendary bananas!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:06.880
Yay! Thank—

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:11.590
<i>Their heart-warming gift exchange 
has ended in a crash!</i>

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.600
I'm going to win and make 
all of Nya-tan mine!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.980
I-It can't...

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:25.650
be!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:29.170
<i>Mo-tan and Usa-tan got tangled 
up in Key-tan and Inu-tan's crash!</i>

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.880
Ouch...

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:31.280
<i>They're both out of the race!</i>

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.990
<b>Dog        Monkey</b>

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.990
<b>Rabbit                 Ox</b>

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.580
Boo!

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:37.690
You all dropped out of that 
race with amazing speed.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.810
That just leaves Shar-tan and...

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:43.290
<b>Snake</b>

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.290
I'm back.

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:44.580
Okay,

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:47.680
that just leaves Uma-tan and Nya-tan.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:49.130
Oh, my God!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.220
Everyone, look at the screen!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.560
Yikes! The god viewership rating!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:59.560
<b>The current god viewership rating is 1.3%.</b>

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:57.180
If it keeps dropping, it'll fall 
below 1% and get canceled!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.560
It's canceled! It's gonna be canceled!

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.570
Don't say it so loudly! 
Uma-tan will hear—

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.440
It's already too late.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:09.410
C-C-C-Canceled?!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:18.990
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 9: "Transferral"] 
An Eto-shin may give her Sol/Lull Seal
 to anyone whose skills she deems worthy, 
regardless of whether they battle. 
The recipient may then give the 
Sol/Lull Seal to another, as well.</b>

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:23.960
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 10: "Ending" 
The ETM12 ends when any of the following 
conditions are met: an Eto-musume collects 
all twelve Eto-shin's Sol/Lull seals, all 108 Eto-musume 
are defeated, or the sixty-day period reaches its end.]</b>

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:27.380
<i>Things are getting dramatic</i>

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.590
<i>at the Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup!</i>

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:33.430
<i>The only racers left are 
Uma-tan and Nya-tan!</i>

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.660
If this keeps up, our god ratings will...

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:38.310
I have to keep it together!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:41.300
Nya-tan and I have to 
see this race through!

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.190
I'm the one who's gonna 
have my wish granted!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.900
By the way, cat, what would your wish be?

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.160
That's obvious! To join the zodiac!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.320
Ah, no...

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:54.870
That wish can only be granted 
through the ETM12.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:55.800
What? Really?!

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.610
Well, of course! 
Just think about it logically!

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:00.920
What? Then there's no point in doing this!

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:02.580
I'm quitting!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.930
H-Hold it!

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:06.940
I-In that case,

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.130
we'll change this race 
into a battle right now!

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:12.010
If you win, you can

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.840
have my Sol/Lull Seal!

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:15.340
Then I'll do it!

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:18.350
I'll go at it with all I've got!

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.100
<i>Then let's begin the battle!</i>

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.100
<b>Approved</b>

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:24.240
Th-Th-This is incredible!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:26.520
Both Uma-tan and Nya-tan refuse to yield!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.230
This race is reaching a heated climax!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.610
<b>The current god viewership rating is 1.6%.</b>

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:33.220
The god rating went back up a bit!

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:35.020
Awesome!

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.020
Wonderful!

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:36.250
That's amazing.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:38.370
Gods are surprisingly easy to please.

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:40.250
<i>She passes me, and I pass her...</i>

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.630
<i>What a perfect race!</i>

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.140
<i>If we keep this up, 
the god rating will reach 3%...</i>

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:47.710
<i>No, 6%!</i>

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:52.000
<i>No, it could even reach 10%!</i>

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.100
<i>Congratulations!</i>

00:17:57.100 --> 00:18:00.190
<i>You've just set a record</i>

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:05.390
<b>Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup</b>

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:03.310
<i>like none ever seen in the 2,000 years</i>

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.860
<i>since the Takamagahara Commemorative Maid 
Café Eto Manager's Cup's beginning!</i>

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:09.630
Th-Thank you!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.400
<b>Thank you for the highest god 
viewership rating ever!!</b>

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.320
Thank you!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.320
With this, I've successfully

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.530
done my job as an Eto-shin!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.350
<i>And the finish line is now drawing near!</i>

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.580
<i>Which racer will claim victory 
in the Takamagahara Commemorative</i>

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.080
<i>Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup?!</i>

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.730
<i>If I cross the finish line first,</i>

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:31.200
<i>this will be the greatest 
Takamagahara Commemorative</i>

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.460
<i>Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup of all ti—</i>

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:38.820
<i>Oh! And now the previously missing 
Erymanthian Boar charges in!</i>

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:40.050
<i>Both racers are sent flying!</i>

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.060
<i>W-Wait...</i>

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.330
Now we'll definitely be canceled...

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:57.360
I'm not done yet!

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.620
I said I'm not done yet!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.240
<i>Nya-tan...</i>

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.570
This is my chance!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:24.810
Now!

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:31.940
Cat Gun!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.920
<i>Nya-tan finishes!</i>

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:37.940
<i>The winner is the 
spur-of-the-moment entry, Nya-tan!</i>

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.940
I did it!

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:41.290
To turn such a

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.930
dire situation into an opportunity...

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:46.910
I won!

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:55.300
<i>This has been the Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup</i>

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:58.130
<i>at Takamagahara's special track, 
with the guardian deity of travelers</i>

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.770
<i>and my special guest, the Manager!</i>

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.060
<i>Great work!</i>

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.360
<i>Yes, same to you!</i>

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:07.470
<b>Takamagahara Commemorative 
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup</b>

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.470
Thank you.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.410
Because of you, I realized something.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.930
A divine ritual should be carried 
out for the gods and the people,

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.990
with all of your heart, 
and with the greatest joy.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:20.740
I was so fixated on god viewership ratings

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:24.220
that I forgot the true 
meaning of the ritual...

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:27.180
There was no way such a ritual 
could be successful.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.750
I'm so ashamed.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.500
I don't think you need to be so sad.

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:35.490
You did your best.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.930
I probably couldn't have 
worked so hard on my own.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.440
You were amazing, Uma-tan!

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:43.510
I was totally frantic!

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.430
So, um, I mean...

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:46.860
You don't have to worry!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:49.300
And anyway, it was fun!

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:50.930
Thanks, Uma-tan!

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:58.450
Nya-tan...

00:20:58.450 --> 00:20:59.410
What is it?

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.200
Uh... Your clothes..

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:01.940
My clothes?

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.680
She used up so much Sol/Lull,

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:06.280
she can't even keep clothes on.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.080
Oh, yes!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.030
Come on, baby!

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:10.790
Whoa, wait!

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:13.390
Stop! Don't touch me there!

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:14.300
Oh, it's ecstasy!

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:16.970
You're so soft...

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:22.130
I'll reflect on my actions.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:25.600
To ensure that the Takamagahara Commemorative

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.760
Maid Café Eto Manager's Cup 
can be held again someday,

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.890
I'll put forth my best effort.

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:36.330
Uma-tan, look at the Sol/Lull TV.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:38.560
<b>This year's average god 
viewership rating was 40.0%.</b>

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.150
<b>This year's average god 
viewership rating was 40.0%.</b>

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.150
What?!

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:43.110
The dramatic climax, from the 
destruction of the course

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:45.430
to the guts Nya-tan showed 
crossing the finish line,

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:49.170
sent the god viewership 
ratings through the roof.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:58.050
The Manager's Cup was a huge success.

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:00.750
So why don't we have an after-party?

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:03.180
Okay!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:47.440
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:39.410
I will now give the fortune for those 
of you born in the year of the horse.

00:23:39.410 --> 00:23:42.120
If you listen closely to 
what I'm about to say,

00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:44.580
your luck will improve!

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:46.920
Rat, ox, tiger, rabbit, 
dragon, snake, horse!

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:48.960
Rat, ox, tiger, rabbit, 
dragon, snake, horse!

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:49.500
Next time: The Beauty of Flowers, 
Bird Steps, and Moon.

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>The Beauty of Flowers, Bird Steps, and Moon</b>

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:50.030
Rat, ox—

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Horse</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Horse! Horse! Horse! Horse! It's horse!!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
Please watch again next week! 
